 "description": "<p>Three pieces and a badge-free attitude: patent leather top, skirt, and tie in black, sized S through L. The tie is what makes the police read - without it this is a black leather set, with it the costume registers instantly.</p>\n<p>Sizing is by weight, and this set is one of the few in the costume line with a genuine three-size run: S for 40-55 kg, M for 50-60 kg, L for 55-65 kg. Overlap is intentional; pick the closer fit for a sharper silhouette.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather</li>\n<li>Includes: top, skirt, tie</li>\n<li>Style: policewoman</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: S (40-55 kg), M (50-60 kg), L (55-65 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The patent finish wipes clean and holds its shine without maintenance - an advantage fabric police costumes never offer.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black patent leather policewoman set with top, skirt and tie in three sizes from S to L by weight.</p>\n",
